| `CONTEXT_LAYER_TASK_SLUG` | Override task_slug | — |
| `SURREAL_URL` | SurrealDB endpoint | `ws://127.0.0.1:8010` |
| `SURREAL_NS` / `SURREAL_DB` | Namespace / Database | `dev` / `context_layer` |
| `SURREAL_USER` / `SURREAL_PASS` | Auth | `root` / `root` |
| `CONTEXT_LAYER_PYTHON` | Venv python path | Auto-detected |
